'''Dynasty Fest''' (超国王祭, ''Chō Kokuōsai'', '''Super King Festival''') is a [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha Event]] that occurs about once every 3 months. It features [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rares]] that are otherwise exclusive to Seasonal Gacha Events. It also features the exclusive [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)|Emperor Cat]] and was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 7%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 67.7%
|LegendChance = 0.3%
}}

